data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `ffmpeg-utils` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/ffmpeg-utils/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/artifacts\npython /mnt/skills/custom/ffmpeg-utils/scripts/run.py --operation segment --input-path /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --start-time 1 --duration 2 --output-path /mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/artifacts/segment.mp4 --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/segment_result.json\npython /mnt/skills/custom/ffmpeg-utils/scripts/run.py --operation keyframe --input-path /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --timestamp 1 --output-path /mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/artifacts/keyframe.jpg --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/keyframe_result.json\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json\nsegment = json.load(open('/mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/segment_result.json'))\nkeyframe = json.load(open('/mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/keyframe_result.json'))\njson.dump({\"skill\":\"ffmpeg-utils\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"status\":\"success\" if segment.get(\"status\") == \"success\" and keyframe.get(\"status\") == \"success\" else \"failed\",\"data\":{\"segment\":segment,\"keyframe\":keyframe}}, open('/mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/result.json','w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/ffmpeg-utils/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"9235fe31-2379-454b-9ee2-a0d503121b04"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":95,"prompt_tokens":9215,"total_tokens":9310,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":37,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":95},"prompt_to